**Reproduced**: `rb run` on `set r to {zebra: 1, alpha: 2, mango: 3, beta: 4, omega: 5}` printed 3 different key orders across 6 runs — `Value::Record(HashMap<String, Value>)` iterated in per-map random order.

**Fix** (+19 −9 production): `src/value.rs:9` adds `pub type Fields = IndexMap<String, Value>`; `Value::Record`/`Value::Object` payloads use it. `src/vm.rs` record construction sites updated (`:276`, `:415`, `:691`, `:939`), plus `src/testing/runner.rs:294` `TypeId`. `indexmap = "2"` added to `Cargo.toml` — already in `Cargo.lock` via `reqwest`, so no new crate.

**Red-then-green**: `test_record_display_preserves_insertion_order` failed on insertion-vs-actual order before any production edit. Re-running all 23 tests against the stashed pre-fix tree: **13 failed, 10 passed** (the 10 are error-path/empty/singleton pins that must hold on both trees).

**Tests**: `tests/record_order_test.rs`, 23 `#[test]`, 0 ignored, 1 `edge_*` (`edge_twenty_key_record_is_identical_across_fifty_runs`), 4 asserting failures. Full edge matrix ticked in `REPORT.md`.

**Gates**: `cargo fmt --check` pass · `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings` pass, 0 warnings · `cargo test --all-targets` 54 passed, 0 failed. **`./rbops/verify.sh phase-004` could not run — `rbops/` and `phases/` do not exist in this checkout.** Substituted: full `examples/`+`modules/`+`tests/` `rb run` sweep, `rb test` on both Redblue suites (12/12, 5/6 + pre-existing skip at `tests/integration_test.rb:26`), `rb lint`. `modules/MathUtils.rb` exits 1 (`ParserError: Expected function name`) — verified identical on the pre-fix tree, so pre-existing.

`phases/phase-004/REPORT.md` and `FINDINGS.md` written; findings cover the missing `rbops/`, the broken `MathUtils.rb`, dead `Value::Object` (`src/vm.rs:270-278` builds an empty `Record`), `stdlib::builtins()` still a `HashMap`, and the lack of a cross-process determinism test.
